{"unit_id":"1HelloMan1__dsh-vision-fallback#card-zh","repo":"1HelloMan1/dsh-vision-fallback","commit":"e94fffbfd1297881e80a1a02304e116541d01368","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-fallback 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的静默视觉桥接插件：聊天中的图片会交由固定视觉模型分析，再把文字观察提供给当前主模型。插件在发送前检测图像，结合用户问题和近期对话构造视觉请求，并以模型专用消息替换保持界面中的原图不变。它还为图片能力元数据提供兼容处理，在上下文压缩时复用已有观察，并提供配置页面调整模型、API 地址、提示词和请求限制。适合希望让文本模型参考聊天截图或附件的 DSH 用户。需要配置视觉服务凭据，并确认图片和相关上下文可以发送到所选视觉 API。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:558-585","lib/index.js:779-854","lib/client.js:316-322"]}
{"unit_id":"1HelloMan1__dsh-vision-fallback#card-en","repo":"1HelloMan1/dsh-vision-fallback","commit":"e94fffbfd1297881e80a1a02304e116541d01368","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-fallback sends chat images to a fixed vision model and gives text observations to the current DSH model. It uses the question and recent context, keeps originals visible in the UI, reuses observations during compaction, and offers web settings. A vision API credential is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:558-585","lib/index.js:779-854","lib/client.js:316-322"]}
